# Build context is the repository root because every service module replaces
# .../internal/pkg with the local ../../pkg directory. Everything that is not
# source code for the Go build is excluded so the context stays small.

**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/azds.yaml
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/out/
**/dist/
LICENSE
README.md
readme.md
local/data/
portainer-data/

# Not needed to compile or run a service.
.github/
assets/
deployments/
docs/
third_party/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/.golangci.yml
**/revive-config.toml
**/staticcheck.conf
